WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.588
Welcome to Module 9 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:04.588 --> 00:00:06.675
govern A I agent identities.

3
00:00:06.675 --> 00:00:10.030
This module teaches the
guide's A I agents section,

4
00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.813
with Chapter 9 of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:18.437
A I agents are non-person identities, and
they follow every gate before this module.

6
00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:22.819
In it you'll check a fictional tenant's
agents against the program's rules,

7
00:00:22.819 --> 00:00:26.470
see the same rules run in a cloud
that has no agent identities,

8
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.413
and plan two report-only Conditional
Access policies for agents.

9
00:00:30.413 --> 00:00:34.176
Then you'll apply one of them to
a fake, by its approved hash.

10
00:00:34.176 --> 00:00:39.000
The tenant and its agents are fictional,
and the apply changes only a fake.

11
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.570
The code is illustrative: tested against
fixtures, not run against a live tenant.
